Phone call script: {{ broker_name }}
{% if broker_phone %}Number: {{ broker_phone }}
{% endif %}

1. "Hello, I'm calling to have my personal information removed from your records and
   to opt out of the sale or sharing of my information."
2. If asked for identifying details, give ONLY what their listing already shows:
   - Name: {{ name }}
{% if city or state %}   - Location: {{ [city, state] | select | join(", ") }}
{% endif %}
{% if age %}   - Approximate age: {{ age }}
{% endif %}
{% for u in listing_urls %}   - Listing: {{ u }}
{% endfor %}
{% if mailbox %}   - Email for confirmation: {{ mailbox }}
{% endif %}
3. Do NOT give your date of birth, Social Security number, payment details or relatives.
{% if not phone %}   Do not give a phone number (phone disclosure is turned off for this person).
{% endif %}
4. Ask for a reference / ticket number and write it down: ________________
5. Ask how long removal takes and note the date: ________________
6. Never agree to pay. Removal requests are free.
{% if statute_name %}
If they refuse: "I'm making this request under the {{ statute_name }}{% if citation %}, {{ citation }}{% endif %}."
{% endif %}
